message: "Wenn du dieses Projekt nutzt oder darauf aufbaust, zitiere es bitte so. / If you use or build on this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Procedural Planets: real-time gas giants, rocky planets and a solar system in WebGPU"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: loveascent
repository-code: "https://github.com/loveascent/procedural-planets"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-22
keywords:
  - webgpu
  - wgsl
  - fluid simulation
  - stable fluids
  - gas giant
  - jupiter
  - procedural planet
  - cube sphere
  - n-body
  - planetary collisions
  - solar system
abstract: >-
  Real-time planets without image textures, rendered with WebGPU/WGSL: gas giants from a
  fluid simulation (Stable Fluids) on a cube-sphere grid, procedural rocky planets with terrain,
  rivers, oceans, atmosphere and clouds, and a solar system with N-body physics and collisions
  after Leinhardt and Stewart (2012).
